  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Portable Ultrasound Machine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance diagnostic services at Lao Friends Hospital for Children (LFHC) by acquiring a new portable ultrasound machine. This will replace an outdated device, enabling faster and more accurate bedside diagnoses, especially for critically ill children and those with heart conditions. The initiative includes equipment procurement, staff training, and integration into key hospital units. Expected benefits include improved diagnostic accuracy, quicker clinical decisions, and better health outcomes, ultimately strengthening LFHC&#x2019;s role as a leading pediatric care provider in northern Laos.</narrative>
  </description>
